# Labels of your answers (the choices). Short; the most specific rule wins. Same context as her line, plus {move}.
# 2026-10-27: 4+ labels per rule ("as opções minhas também são muito iguais").

# ---------------- ask ----------------
@rule move.ask
on move.ask
- [Ask more about {thing}|Ask her to tell you more|Ask her to go on|Ask what she means|Ask what she's thinking]

@rule move.ask.low
on move.ask
when kind=day low=yes
- [Ask what's wrong|Ask what's bothering her|Ask if she's okay|Ask what happened|Ask gently what's up]

@rule move.ask.good
on move.ask
when kind=day mood=cheerful
- [Ask what's got her so happy|Ask what made her day|Ask why she's smiling|Ask what the good news is]

@rule move.ask.gossip
on move.ask
when kind=gossip
- [Ask how it happened|Ask for the details|Ask how she found out|Ask if it's really true|Ask who else knows]

@rule move.ask.heard
on move.ask
when kind=you how=heard|rumor
- [Ask who's saying that|Ask who told her|Ask where she heard it|Ask what exactly they're saying]

@rule move.ask.saw
on move.ask
when kind=you how=witness
- [Ask what she saw|Ask how she feels about it|Ask what she thinks of you now|Ask how much she saw]

@rule move.ask.us
on move.ask
when kind=us
- [Ask how she felt about it|Ask what she thought|Ask what she liked most|Ask if she'd do it again]

@rule move.ask.like
on move.ask
when kind=small likes=yes
- [Ask what she loves about {like}|Ask how she got into {like}|Ask for her favorite kind of {like}|Ask her to teach you about {like}]

@rule move.ask.like.no
on move.ask
when kind=small likes=no
- [Ask what she likes instead|Ask why {like} isn't her thing|Ask what she'd rather talk about|Ask if she's ever given {like} a chance]

@rule move.ask.friend
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=friend
- [Ask how she met {bff}|Ask what {bff} is like|Ask what they do together|Ask if {bff} has a boyfriend]

@rule move.ask.birthday
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=birthday
- [Ask what she wants for her birthday|Ask how she usually celebrates|Ask if she has plans for it|Ask how old she's turning]

@rule move.ask.horoscope
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=horoscope
- [Ask what her sign says about her|Ask if your signs match|Ask what today's horoscope said|Ask if she believes in fate]

@rule move.ask.club
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=club
- [Ask what the {club} is working on|Ask who's in the {club}|Ask if the {club} takes new members|Ask what she does at the {club}]

@rule move.ask.school
on move.ask
when kind=school
- [Ask about her plans|Ask what she's expecting|Ask if she's ready|Ask what she'll do]

# ---------------- comfort ----------------
@rule move.comfort
on move.comfort
- [Tell her it'll be okay|Reassure her|Say you're on her side|Tell her not to worry|Say things will get better]

@rule move.comfort.stress
on move.comfort
when kind=day mood=stressed
- [Say she's doing her best|Tell her not to push herself|Offer to help her through it|Tell her to take a breather]

@rule move.comfort.lonely
on move.comfort
when kind=day mood=lonely
- [Say you're here now|Tell her she's not alone|Say you'll keep her company|Say you were hoping to see her]

@rule move.comfort.upset
on move.comfort
when kind=day mood=upset
- [Just stay with her|Say she doesn't have to talk|Sit quietly beside her|Tell her you're listening]

@rule move.comfort.fight
on move.comfort
when realverb=fought|insulted|broke_up
- [Say it'll blow over|Tell her it's not her fault|Say they'll make up|Tell her she did nothing wrong]

@rule move.comfort.hurt
on move.comfort
when kind=you rel=girlfriend|lover
- [Tell her she matters to you|Take her hand|Say she comes first|Promise it won't hurt her again]

# ---------------- share ----------------
@rule move.share
on move.share
- [Share your own take|Tell her what you think|Give your opinion|Tell her how you see it|Share a story of yours]

@rule move.share.day
on move.share
when kind=day
- [Tell her about your day|Share how your day went|Tell her something funny from class|Complain about your classes]

@rule move.share.us
on move.share
when kind=us
- [Say you liked it too|Tell her how you felt|Say it was special to you|Say you keep thinking about it]

@rule move.share.like
on move.share
when kind=small likes=yes|no
- [Say what you think of {like}|Share your own taste|Say you're into {like} too|Admit you know little about {like}]

@rule move.share.friend
on move.share
when kind=small subject=friend
- [Talk about your own friends|Say you'd like to meet {bff}|Say they make a good pair|Say you're glad she has someone]

@rule move.share.horoscope
on move.share
when kind=small subject=horoscope
- [Tell her your own sign|Say you don't believe in it|Say yours said you'd meet someone|Joke about your bad luck today]

@rule move.praise.birthday
on move.praise
when kind=small subject=birthday birthday=today
- [Wish her a happy birthday|Tell her she's the best birthday girl|Say you're glad she was born|Sing her a little birthday song]

# ---------------- tease ----------------
@rule move.tease
on move.tease
- [Tease her a little|Poke fun at her|Make a cheeky remark|Give her a hard time|Grin and needle her]

@rule move.tease.sleepy
on move.tease
when kind=day mood=sleepy
- {student}[Tease her about dozing off|Call her a sleepyhead|Ask if she slept in class|Offer her a pillow, grinning]

@rule move.tease.hungry
on move.tease
when kind=day mood=hungry
- [Tease her about her appetite|Joke about her stomach|Ask if she heard that growl|Wave a snack in front of her]

@rule move.tease.couple
on move.tease
when realverb=started_dating|crush|seen_together
- [Tease her about the couple|Ask if she's jealous|Ask if she's next|Joke that she wants one too]

@rule move.tease.us
on move.tease
when kind=us romance=yes
- [Tease her about blushing|Say she's cute when flustered|Point out her red face|Ask why she won't look at you]

@rule move.tease.you
on move.tease
when kind=you
- [Ask if she liked what she saw|Joke about it|Ask if she's jealous|Wink and say nothing]

# ---------------- praise ----------------
@rule move.praise
on move.praise
- [Compliment her|Say something nice|Tell her she's great|Praise her honestly|Say you admire her]

@rule move.praise.day
on move.praise
when kind=day mood=cheerful
- [Say her smile suits her|Say it's nice seeing her happy|Say her mood is contagious|Say she's glowing today]

@rule move.praise.club
on move.praise
when hasclub=yes kind=school
- [Praise her work at the {club}|Say the {club} is lucky to have her|Say she's the heart of the {club}|Say the {club} needs her]

# ---------------- invite ----------------
@rule move.invite
on move.invite
- [Suggest doing something together|Ask if she wants to hang out|Ask her out after class|Ask if she's free later|Suggest you meet up]

@rule move.invite.food
on move.invite
when kind=day mood=hungry
- [Offer to get food together|Offer to share your lunch|Suggest the cafeteria|Offer to buy her a snack]

@rule move.invite.bored
on move.invite
when kind=day mood=bored
- [Suggest something fun|Offer to break the boredom|Suggest skipping to the roof|Propose a little adventure]

@rule move.invite.study
on move.invite
when kind=day exam=yes
- {student}[Offer to study together|Suggest a study session|Offer to quiz each other|Suggest the library after class]

@rule move.invite.event
on move.invite
when kind=school school=event
- [Ask her to go with you|Suggest going together|Ask if she has company for it|Offer to be her partner for it]

@rule move.invite.again
on move.invite
when kind=us
- [Suggest doing it again|Ask for a next time|Ask when you can repeat it|Suggest the same place next week]

@rule move.invite.like
on move.invite
when likes=yes
- {student}[Invite her to {likedo}|Suggest you {likedo} after class|Ask if she wants to {likedo} with you|Offer to {likedo} together]

@rule move.invite.subject
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=club|friend|birthday|horoscope|future|teaching
- {student}[Ask if she wants to {favdo} sometime|Suggest you hang out after class|Ask if she's free this weekend|Offer to walk her home later]

@rule move.invite.birthday
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=birthday birthday=today|week|soon
- [Offer to celebrate her birthday together|Ask if you can take her out for her birthday|Promise her a birthday cake|Ask what she wants to do on her birthday]

# ---------------- the rest ----------------
@rule move.correct
on move.correct
- [Tell her what really happened|Set the story straight|Say that's not how it went|Explain your side]

@rule move.agree
on move.agree
- [Agree with her|Nod along|Say she has a point|Say you thought the same]

@rule move.defend
on move.defend
- [Stick up for {who}|Say {who} isn't like that|Defend {who}|Ask her to go easy on {who}]

@rule move.laugh
on move.laugh
- [Laugh it off|Make a joke of it|Chuckle and shrug|Say it's kind of funny]

@rule move.admit
on move.admit
- [Admit it|Own up to it|Say it's true|Don't hide it]

@rule move.admit.close
on move.admit
when rel=girlfriend|lover kind=you
- [Tell her the truth|Apologize and come clean|Say you're sorry and explain|Admit it and hold her hand]

@rule move.hush
on move.hush
- [Ask her to keep it quiet|Ask her not to tell anyone|Ask her to keep it between you|Ask her to forget it]

@rule move.deny
on move.deny
- [Deny it|Say she's mistaken|Play dumb|Say it wasn't you]

@rule move.thank
on move.thank
- [Thank her|Say thanks|Tell her you're grateful|Thank her with a smile]

@rule move.change
on move.change
- [Change the subject|Talk about something else|Move on to something else|Bring up something else]

@rule move.ask.sleepy
on move.ask
when kind=day mood=sleepy
- [Ask what kept her up|Ask why she's so tired|Ask when she went to bed|Ask if she slept at all]

@rule move.ask.hungry
on move.ask
when kind=day mood=hungry
- [Ask when she last ate|Ask why she skipped breakfast|Ask what she's craving|Ask what she'd eat right now]

@rule move.ask.bored
on move.ask
when kind=day mood=bored
- [Ask what she'd rather be doing|Ask what would cheer up her day|Ask why today's so slow|Ask what she does for fun]

@rule move.ask.lonely
on move.ask
when kind=day mood=lonely
- [Ask where her friends are|Ask why she's alone today|Ask who she usually sits with|Ask if she wants company]

@rule move.ask.fight
on move.ask
when kind=day fight=yes
- [Ask what happened with {fightwho}|Ask what started the fight|Ask if she'll talk to {fightwho}|Ask how bad it is with {fightwho}]

# ================= 2026-10-31: the options answer what she just said =================
# {said} is the rule of her last line: the most exact way to answer it. Below that, the topic and its subject. Her mood alone never
# picks an option: it answered the mood, not the line (tools/dlg_fix_options.py).

# ---------------- small talk, by subject ----------------
@rule move.ask.small
on move.ask
when kind=small
- [Ask what she thinks about {thing}|Ask why she says that|Ask what she means|Ask her to say more]

@rule move.ask.weather
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=weather
- [Ask what weather she likes best|Ask if she minds it|Ask if she brought an umbrella|Ask how it looks later]

@rule move.share.weather
on move.share
when kind=small subject=weather
- [Say what you think of it|Say you like this weather too|Say you can't stand it|Say it makes you sleepy too]

@rule move.tease.weather
on move.tease
when kind=small subject=weather
- [Joke about the weather|Say she sounds like the forecast|Ask if she ordered this weather|Bet it changes in an hour]

@rule move.invite.weather
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=weather
- [Suggest going outside|Suggest finding somewhere nice to sit|Suggest getting something warm|Suggest a walk later]

@rule move.invite.weather.rain
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=weather wet=yes
- [Offer to share your umbrella|Suggest waiting it out together|Suggest getting something warm|Offer to walk her home]

@rule move.comfort.storm
on move.comfort
when kind=small subject=weather weather=storm
- [Say the storm will pass soon|Tell her it's safe in here|Say you'll stay until it stops|Tell her you've got her]

@rule move.ask.lunch
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=lunch
- [Ask what she brought|Ask what's good today|Ask if she made it herself|Ask where she likes to eat]

@rule move.share.lunch
on move.share
when kind=small subject=lunch
- [Say what you're having|Say you skipped breakfast|Complain about the line|Say what you'd rather eat]

@rule move.tease.lunch
on move.tease
when kind=small subject=lunch
- [Joke about her lunch|Offer to taste it for her|Ask if there's enough for two|Say you'll steal a bite]

@rule move.invite.lunch
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=lunch
- [Ask to eat together|Offer to swap lunches|Suggest eating on the roof|Offer to buy her a drink]

@rule move.ask.weekend
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=weekend
- [Ask what she'd like to do|Ask if she's going out|Ask where she'd go|Ask what she usually does]

@rule move.share.weekend
on move.share
when kind=small subject=weekend
- [Tell her your plans|Say you've got nothing planned either|Say you'll sleep till noon|Say you're counting the days]

@rule move.invite.weekend
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=weekend
- [Ask her out this weekend|Suggest going somewhere together|Ask if she's free on Saturday|Offer to go with her]

@rule move.ask.place
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=place
- [Ask why she comes here|Ask how often she's here|Ask what she does here|Ask what she likes about it]

@rule move.share.place
on move.share
when kind=small subject=place
- [Say you like it here too|Say you never noticed this place|Say what you think of it|Say it's nice to get away]

@rule move.tease.place
on move.tease
when kind=small subject=place
- [Joke about this place|Say you've caught her here again|Ask if she lives here now|Say you know her hiding spot now]

@rule move.invite.place
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=place
- [Ask if you can stay with her|Suggest staying a little longer|Suggest going somewhere else together|Ask her to show you around]

@rule move.comfort.exams
on move.comfort
when said=school.exam|school.teacher.exam|small.exams|small.exams.teacher|small.place.classroom.exam|small.place.library.books.exam
- [Say she'll do fine|Tell her not to panic|Say you're behind too|Say she's got time]

@rule move.invite.exams
on move.invite
when said=school.exam|school.teacher.exam|small.exams|small.exams.teacher|small.place.classroom.exam|small.place.library.books.exam
- {student}[Offer to study together|Suggest a study session|Offer to quiz each other|Suggest the library after class]

@rule move.share.exams
on move.share
when kind=small subject=exams
- [Say you haven't studied either|Say which subject scares you|Complain about the exams|Say you just want them over]

@rule move.ask.exams
on move.ask
when said=small.place.classroom.exam|small.place.library.books.exam|small.exams.teacher
- [Ask which subject worries her|Ask how the studying is going|Ask if she's ready|Ask what's on the test]

@rule move.share.school
on move.share
when kind=small subject=school
- {student}[Complain about the assignments|Say you feel the same|Say which class you can't stand|Say you can't wait for the break]

@rule move.ask.subject.school
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=school
- {student}[Ask which class she likes|Ask which professor is the worst|Ask how her classes are going|Ask what she'd change]

@rule move.tease.school
on move.tease
when kind=small subject=school
- {student}[Joke about her grades|Ask if she was awake in class|Say she sounds like a professor|Bet she forgot the assignments]

@rule move.tease.like.yes
on move.tease
when kind=small likes=yes
- [Tease her about {like}|Say she's obsessed with {like}|Joke that {like} is all she thinks about|Bet you're better at {like}]

@rule move.tease.like.no
on move.tease
when kind=small likes=no
- [Tease her for not liking {like}|Say she's missing out on {like}|Joke about her and {like}|Bet she'd come round to {like}]

@rule move.praise.like
on move.praise
when kind=small likes=yes
- [Say she must be good at it|Say it suits her|Say it's great that she loves {like}|Say you admire how much she cares]

@rule move.praise.small.club
on move.praise
when kind=small subject=club
- [Say she works hard|Say the {club} is lucky to have her|Say it sounds like she's doing great|Say you admire her for it]

@rule move.invite.small.club
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=club
- [Offer to drop by the {club}|Ask if you can watch sometime|Offer to help the {club}|Suggest walking home after the {club}]

@rule move.praise.friend
on move.praise
when kind=small subject=friend
- [Say {bff} is lucky to have her|Say it's nice to have a friend like that|Say she's a good friend|Say they sound great together]

@rule move.tease.friend
on move.tease
when kind=small subject=friend
- [Joke about the two of them|Ask who's the troublemaker|Say they sound like a comedy duo|Ask what {bff} says about her]

@rule move.comfort.friend
on move.comfort
when kind=small subject=friend
- [Say you only asked about her|Say she's the one you came to see|Tell her she has nothing to worry about|Say you're here for her]

@rule move.praise.small.birthday
on move.praise
when kind=small subject=birthday
- [Say she deserves a good one|Say you'll remember the date|Say you're glad you asked|Say she's a treat to celebrate]

@rule move.tease.birthday
on move.tease
when kind=small subject=birthday
- [Joke about her getting old|Ask if she wants a very big cake|Say you'll count the candles|Ask if she's dropping hints]

@rule move.tease.horoscope
on move.tease
when kind=small subject=horoscope
- [Joke about her sign|Ask if the stars said you'd talk|Say that explains a lot|Ask if your luck is her fault]

@rule move.ask.future
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=future
- [Ask what she wants to do|Ask where she'd like to go|Ask what she dreams of|Ask if she's decided yet]

@rule move.praise.future
on move.praise
when kind=small subject=future
- [Say she'll do great|Say you believe in her|Say it suits her|Say she'll get there]

@rule move.share.future
on move.share
when kind=small subject=future
- [Share your own plans|Say you haven't decided either|Say what you dream of|Say you're a bit scared of it]

@rule move.invite.future
on move.invite
when kind=small subject=future
- [Say you'd like to be part of it|Ask if there's room for you in it|Say you'll go with her|Suggest thinking it over together]

@rule move.ask.teaching
on move.ask
when kind=small subject=teaching
- [Ask what the hard part is|Ask why she became a professor|Ask about her worst class|Ask if she'd do it again]

@rule move.praise.teaching
on move.praise
when kind=small subject=teaching
- [Say she's a good professor|Say her class is your favorite|Say the students like her|Say you learn a lot from her]

@rule move.comfort.teaching
on move.comfort
when kind=small subject=teaching
- [Say she should rest more|Say the students notice how hard she works|Tell her not to overdo it|Say it's okay to be tired]

@rule move.praise.small
on move.praise
when kind=small rel=stranger|acquaintance
- [Say it's nice to talk to her|Say she's easy to talk to|Say you're glad you said hi|Say she seems nice]

# ---------------- small talk, line by line ----------------
@rule move.ask.said.fight
on move.ask
when said=small.place.fight|small.place.infirmary.fight|small.place.library.books.fight|small.place.library.books.rain.fight
- [Ask what happened with {fightwho}|Ask what started the fight|Ask if she'll talk to {fightwho}|Ask how bad it is with {fightwho}]

@rule move.comfort.said.fight
on move.comfort
when said=small.place.fight|small.place.infirmary.fight|small.place.library.books.fight|small.place.library.books.rain.fight
- [Say it'll blow over|Tell her it's not her fault|Say she can stay here as long as she likes|Say you'll keep her company]

@rule move.tease.said.rival
on move.tease
when said=small.place.rivalnear
- [Joke about {rivalnear}|Offer to hide her from {rivalnear}|Say {rivalnear} heard her|Ask if she wants to go say hi]

@rule move.ask.said.rival
on move.ask
when said=small.place.rivalnear
- [Ask what's with her and {rivalnear}|Ask what {rivalnear} did|Ask how long this has gone on|Ask if she wants to leave]

@rule move.tease.said.sleepy
on move.tease
when said=small.place.infirmary.sleepy
- {student}[Tease her about napping here|Call her a sleepyhead|Ask if she's really sick|Say you'll tell the nurse]

@rule move.comfort.said.sleepy
on move.comfort
when said=small.place.infirmary.sleepy
- [Tell her to get some sleep|Say you'll wake her before class|Say you'll keep watch|Say she's earned the rest]

@rule move.tease.said.rain
on move.tease
when said=small.weather.rain.outside|small.place.rooftop.rain|small.place.courtyard.rain|small.place.field.rain|small.place.pool.rain|small.place.classroom.rain|small.place.gym.rain|small.place.cafeteria.rain
- [Joke about the rain|Say she looks like a wet cat|Ask who picked this place|Say the rain followed her here]

@rule move.invite.said.rain
on move.invite
when said=small.weather.rain.outside|small.place.rooftop.rain|small.place.rooftop.lover|small.place.courtyard.rain|small.place.field.rain|small.place.gym.rain|small.place.library.rain|small.place.clubroom.rain
- [Offer to share your umbrella|Suggest going in somewhere dry|Suggest waiting it out together|Offer to walk her home]

@rule move.comfort.said.rain
on move.comfort
when said=small.weather.rain.gentle|small.place.rooftop.rain
- [Say she can stay as long as she wants|Say you'll stay with her|Tell her she doesn't have to be alone|Say the rain will pass]

# ---------------- school ----------------
@rule move.share.kind.school
on move.share
when kind=school
- [Tell her what you think of {event}|Say you haven't thought about it]

@rule move.tease.kind.school
on move.tease
when kind=school
- [Joke about {event}|Ask if she's even ready]

@rule move.comfort.kind.school
on move.comfort
when kind=school
- [Tell her not to worry about {event}|Say it'll work out]

# ---------------- gossip ----------------
@rule move.tease.gossip
on move.tease
when kind=gossip
- [Ask if she's jealous|Say she loves this stuff|Ask how she knows everything|Joke about it]

@rule move.comfort.gossip
on move.comfort
when said=gossip.friend.worried
- [Say {who} will get through it|Say it's kind of her to worry|Say {who} is lucky to have her|Offer to help {who} too]

@rule move.praise.gossip
on move.praise
when said=gossip.friend.happy
- [Say she's a good friend|Say it's nice she's happy for {who}|Say {who} is lucky to have her|Say you like that about her]

# ---------------- about you ----------------
@rule move.share.you
on move.share
when kind=you
- [Tell her your side|Say it's not a big deal|Say it's nothing serious|Say you'd rather not talk about it]

@rule move.comfort.you
on move.comfort
when kind=you
- [Say nothing's changed between you|Say she still matters to you|Tell her not to worry about it|Say you're sorry she heard it this way]

@rule move.invite.you
on move.invite
when kind=you
- [Say you still have time for her|Promise to hang out soon|Ask if you can make it up to her|Suggest talking about it later]

@rule move.ask.said.admit
on move.ask
when said=react.admit.good.go
- [Ask what she wants to know|Ask what she's thinking|Ask if she's mad|Ask what you can do]

@rule move.comfort.said.admit
on move.comfort
when said=react.admit.good.go
- [Say you're sorry it hurt her|Say she still matters to you|Promise to talk it through|Say you never meant to upset her]

# ---------------- what you did together ----------------
@rule move.tease.us.plain
on move.tease
when kind=us
- [Grin and bring it up again|Ask if she's still thinking about it|Say she's cute when she remembers|Joke about that day]

@rule move.share.said.gift
on move.share
when said=us.gift.liked|us.gift.meh
- [Say you picked it for her|Say you're glad she has it|Tell her why you chose it|Say it made you think of her]

@rule move.ask.said.gift
on move.ask
when said=us.gift.meh
- [Ask if she really likes it|Ask what she'd have liked|Ask where she put it|Ask if you got it wrong]

@rule move.invite.said.gift
on move.invite
when said=us.gift.liked
- [Suggest using it together|Offer to find her another one|Suggest going to that shop together|Ask her to show you where it is]

@rule move.tease.said.gift
on move.tease
when said=us.gift.liked
- [Say you expect one back|Ask if she sleeps with it|Say you have great taste|Say she owes you now]

@rule move.share.said.help
on move.share
when said=us.helped|us.defended|us.promise
- [Say it was nothing|Say anyone would have done it|Say you were glad to help|Say you'd do it again]

@rule move.praise.said.help
on move.praise
when said=us.helped|us.defended|us.promise
- [Say she'd do the same for you|Say she deserves it|Say she's worth it|Say you like seeing her smile]

@rule move.tease.said.help
on move.tease
when said=us.helped|us.defended
- [Say she owes you one|Say you'll collect later|Say you're a hero now|Ask what the reward is]

@rule move.thank.said.help
on move.thank
when said=us.promise|us.gift.meh
- [Say thanks for telling you|Say it means a lot|Say you're glad she noticed|Thank her with a smile]

@rule move.share.said.lunch
on move.share
when said=us.lunch
- [Say you liked eating together|Say it was the best part of your day|Say the time flew|Say her company beats the food]

@rule move.tease.said.lunch
on move.tease
when said=us.lunch
- [Joke about how fast you eat|Say you'll judge her bento|Ask who's paying next time|Say you're expecting a feast]

@rule move.invite.said.lunch
on move.invite
when said=us.lunch
- [Ask to eat together again|Suggest lunch tomorrow|Suggest a new place to eat|Say you'll save her a seat]

@rule move.share.said.walk
on move.share
when said=us.walk
- [Say you liked walking with her|Say it went by too fast|Say you got home fine too|Say it was a good walk]

@rule move.tease.said.walk
on move.tease
when said=us.walk
- [Tease her about the walk|Say you walk too fast for her|Ask if anyone saw you|Say next time she carries the bags]

@rule move.invite.said.walk
on move.invite
when said=us.walk
- {student}[Suggest the long way next time|Offer to walk her home again|Suggest stopping somewhere on the way|Say you'll wait for her after class]

# ---------------- what you told her ----------------
@rule move.ask.tell
on move.ask
when kind=tell
- [Tell her what you know|Give her the details|Tell her the rest|Say who told you]

@rule move.share.tell
on move.share
when kind=tell
- [Say what you think about it|Say it surprised you too|Say you only just found out|Say it's not your business either]

@rule move.defend.tell
on move.defend
when kind=tell
- [Say you're worried about {who}|Say you meant no harm|Say you told her out of concern|Say you're on {who}'s side]

@rule move.agree.tell
on move.agree
when kind=tell
- [Say you didn't see it coming either|Say you thought the same|Say it's big news|Say she called it]

@rule move.tease.tell
on move.tease
when kind=tell
- [Ask if she's jealous|Say she loves this stuff|Say you knew she'd react like that|Joke about it]

# ---------------- what you confessed ----------------
@rule move.ask.confide
on move.ask
when kind=confide
- [Ask what she thinks|Ask if she's okay with it|Ask if she's upset|Ask what she'd do]

@rule move.share.confide
on move.share
when kind=confide
- [Tell her how it happened|Say it just happened|Say how you feel about it|Say you wanted her to hear it from you]

@rule move.tease.confide
on move.tease
when kind=confide
- [Ask if she's jealous|Joke about your love life|Say she's taking it well|Wink and say nothing]

@rule move.comfort.confide
on move.comfort
when kind=confide
- [Say it doesn't change things with her|Say she still matters to you|Say you're sorry if it hurt|Promise you won't hide things]

@rule move.thank.confide
on move.thank
when kind=confide
- [Thank her for understanding|Say you're glad you told her|Say it means a lot|Say you owe her one]

# ---------------- when she answers and it goes on ----------------
@rule move.invite.said.stay
on move.invite
when said=react.comfort.good.go
- [Say you'll stay with her|Suggest getting some fresh air|Suggest going somewhere to clear her head|Offer to walk with her]

@rule move.share.said.stay
on move.share
when said=react.comfort.good.go
- [Tell her something funny|Tell her about your day|Say you're happy to listen|Say you've had days like that]

@rule move.tease.said.stay
on move.tease
when said=react.comfort.good.go
- [Make a silly joke to cheer her up|Pull a funny face|Say she owes you a smile|Say she's cute when she's better]

@rule move.share.said.tell
on move.share
when said=react.share.good.go
- [Tell her more|Tell her how it ended|Say there's more to it|Tell her the funny part]

@rule move.share.said.plan
on move.share
when said=react.invite.good.go
- [Tell her what you have in mind|Say you'll plan the whole thing|Say you'll surprise her|Say to leave it to you]

@rule move.praise.said.plan
on move.praise
when said=react.invite.good.go
- [Say you're looking forward to it|Say you're glad she said yes|Say it'll be better with her|Say you can't wait]

@rule move.tease.said.plan
on move.tease
when said=react.invite.good.go
- [Say she sounds excited|Joke that she'd better not be late|Say you might just pay|Ask if it's a date]

@rule move.praise.said.spar
on move.praise
when said=react.tease.good.go
- [Say she's fun to tease|Say you only do it because you like her|Admit she's quicker than you|Say you give up, she wins]

@rule move.invite.said.spar
on move.invite
when said=react.tease.good.go
- {student}[Offer to make it up to her|Offer to buy her something|Suggest settling it after class|Offer a truce over a snack]

# ---------------- small talk, by what kind of line hers was (2026-10-31) ----------------
# A statement, a question or something she offers: the options answer that. These win over the rules by subject.
@rule move.ask.state
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=state
- [Ask her to tell you more|Ask why she says that|Ask what she means|Ask how she feels about it]

@rule move.share.state
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state
- [Say what you think|Give her your take|Tell her how you see it]

@rule move.share.state.like
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state likes=yes
- [Say you like {like} too|Say you've been getting into {like}|Tell her what you like about {like}]

@rule move.tease.state
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=state
- [Tease her about it|Joke about it|Make a joke|Tease her a little]

@rule move.praise.state
on move.praise
when kind=small shape=state
- [Say that's great|Say you like that about her|Say good for her]

@rule move.comfort.state
on move.comfort
when kind=small shape=state
- [Say it'll be okay|Tell her it's all right|Say you're there for her|Cheer her up]

@rule move.invite.state
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=state likes=yes
- [Suggest doing it together|Ask to join her sometime|Say you'd like to try it with her]

@rule move.share.q
on move.share
when kind=small shape=q
- [Answer her|Tell her what you think|Give her an honest answer]

@rule move.ask.q
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=q
- [Ask her the same thing|Turn the question around|Ask what she'd say]

@rule move.tease.q
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=q
- [Answer with a joke|Dodge with a joke|Give her a silly answer]

@rule move.invite.offer
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=offer
- [Say you'd like that|Say yes|Take her up on it|Say you're in]

@rule move.ask.offer
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=offer
- [Ask what she has in mind|Ask her for the details]

@rule move.tease.offer
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=offer
- [Tease her for asking|Ask if she's serious|Say only if she's paying]

@rule move.invite.show
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=show
- [Say you'd love to see it|Say yes, show her|Say you want to see]

@rule move.ask.show
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=show
- [Ask what it's like|Ask what's so special about it|Ask why she's showing you]

@rule move.tease.show
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=show
- [Tease her for showing off|Ask if it's any good|Say you've seen better]

@rule move.invite.tell
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=tell
- [Say you want to hear it|Ask her to tell you|Say you're listening]

@rule move.ask.tell
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=tell
- [Ask what it's about|Ask who told her|Ask if it's any good]

@rule move.tease.tell
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=tell
- [Say you'd rather not know|Ask if it's another of her stories|Say you already know]

@rule move.invite.give
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=give
- [Say yes|Say sure, thanks|Take her up on it]

@rule move.ask.give
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=give
- [Ask if she's sure|Ask if it's any good]

@rule move.tease.give
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=give
- [Tease her about it|Ask if it's safe|Ask what the catch is]
